EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,



This is a formal request for the commission return of {!Opportunity.Broker_Commission__c}

Customer completed {!Case.Payments_Collected__c} payments before beginning to bounce payments and going dark. We are going to be proceeding with litigation on this file and will need commission returned.

Please confirm your authorization to ACH back the commission from the account on file. Wire instructions can also be provided upon request

Thank you,


{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
